      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "What is the slope of the line $-4x=5?$",
      "worked_solution": "Note that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4x & =5 \\\\ x & =-\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the line is vertical, and its slope is undefined.",
